    <p><em>Last updated: October 11, 2026</em></p>

    <h2>Using this website</h2>
    <p>By using Talha M Blog you agree to these terms. If you do not agree, please do not use the website.</p>

    <h2>Our content</h2>
    <ul>
      <li>Our articles are written for general information and education. They are summaries and explanations of news and public information, written in simple English.</li>
      <li>You may read and share links to our articles freely.</li>
      <li>You may quote a short part of an article if you clearly credit Talha M Blog and link back to the original article.</li>
      <li>You may not copy full articles and publish them as your own work.</li>
    </ul>

    <h2>Accuracy</h2>
    <p>We try to keep every article accurate and up to date, and we correct mistakes when they are reported to us. News changes quickly, so we cannot guarantee that every detail is complete or current at all times. Please read our <a href="/disclaimer/">disclaimer</a> as well.</p>

    <h2>External links</h2>
    <p>We link to outside websites as sources. We do not control those websites and are not responsible for their content.</p>

    <h2>Changes to these terms</h2>
    <p>We may update these terms from time to time. The current version will always be on this page.</p>

    <h2>Contact</h2>
    <p>Questions about these terms can be sent through our <a href="/contact/">contact page</a>.</p>
  </div>
</Base>
